<title>JAPAN: Hakuto - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hakuto - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.08		vs	   34.13</p>
<p> Operating	  698 million	 vs	    1.44</p>
<p> Current	    789 million	 vs	    1.14</p>
<p> Net		  508 million	 vs	  493 million</p>
<p> EPS		   32.27 yen	  vs	   34.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hakuto Co Ltd is a wholesaler of electronic parts and equipment for electronic makers.</p>
